@page "/"

<PageTitle>Bdnd samples</PageTitle>

<h1>Bdnd samples</h1>

<p>
    One set of pages hosted unchanged by three Blazor Web Apps - <strong>Server</strong> (Interactive Server),
    <strong>Wasm</strong> (Interactive WebAssembly) and <strong>Auto</strong> (Interactive Auto), each prerendering
    first - and by a <strong>MAUI</strong> Blazor Hybrid app for Android, iOS, macOS and Windows. Every drag works the
    same in each: on WebAssembly its events are handled in the browser, on Server they cross the circuit, and in the
    MAUI app they cross the web view's bridge to .NET.
</p>

<div class="card">
    <h2>Where this page is running</h2>
    <dl>
        <dt>Renderer</dt>
        <dd id="renderer">@RendererInfo.Name</dd>
        <dt>Interactive</dt>
        <dd id="interactive">@(RendererInfo.IsInteractive ? "yes" : AssignedRenderMode is null ? "no, rendered statically" : "no, prerendered")</dd>
    </dl>
    <p class="muted">
        Prerendered markup shows every draggable and drop target idle: they start working once the page is
        interactive.
    </p>
</div>

<h2>Samples</h2>
<ul>
    <li><NavLink href="dustbin">Dustbin</NavLink> - boxes dropped in bins that take some types and refuse others, with the mouse, a finger or the keyboard</li>
    <li><NavLink href="sortable">Sortable</NavLink> - two lists with drop indicators, reordered and moved between with <code>BdndList</code></li>
    <li><NavLink href="previews">Previews</NavLink> - a custom drag layer, a drag handle, and pointer drags for the mouse as well</li>
    <li><NavLink href="native">Native drops</NavLink> - files, text and links dragged in from outside the page</li>
</ul>
